<title>USA: Tele-Communications sets Liberty div date.</title>
<headline>Tele-Communications sets Liberty div date.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tele-Communications Inc on Monday said it set January 14, 1997, as the ex-dividend date for the Liberty Group stock dividend.</p>
<p>The company said the stock dividend would provide Liberty Media Group shareholders with one share of Liberty Media Group Series A stock for every two shares of Liberty Media Group Series A or Series B stock held.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable January 13, 1997, to shareholders of record as of December 27.</p>
</text>
